# Running the CSAS Frontend Locally

## Prerequisites

Before running the project, make sure you have the following installed:

- Visual Studio Code (VS Code)
- Live Server Extension for VS Code

### Download VS Code

[https://code.visualstudio.com/](https://code.visualstudio.com/)

### Install Live Server (Extention in VS code)

1. Open VS Code
2. Click the **Extensions** icon on the left sidebar
3. Search for **Live Server**
4. Install **Live Server** by Ritwick Dey

---

## Running the Project

### 1\. Clone the Repository

### git clone <repository\-url>2. Open the Project

Open the project folder in VS Code.

### 3\. Navigate to the Frontend Folder

Locate the frontend folder that contains the HTML files:

frontend/

├── index.html

├── login.html

├── dashboard.html

├── appointments.html

├── students.html

### 4\. Launch the Website

Right\-click on:

index.html

and select:

Open With Live Server

A browser window will automatically open displaying the website.

