## Notes

- This project currently runs entirely on the frontend using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.
- User login status is stored locally using browser localStorage.
- No database or backend server is required to run the current version.
- If login issues occur, open the browser console (F12) and run:

localStorage.clear();

Then refresh the page.

